# RPM Apprentice Firmware


Download the WMH-RPM-Apprentice-Bootstrap-1.055.zip file and extract the contents.
Remove top half of RPM Apprentice, with the USB connected, press the boot button and hold, 
then press and release the reset button, then release the boot button.
Run the exe in the folder you extracted, click through the warnings...
Let the program finish updating the RPM Apprentice, once finished unplug the USB put the top half of the case back on and turn it on.
You will have a touch calibration screen, then it will run normally.  Further updates can be done through the Wizard Portal app. 

Firmware releases and update tools for the WMH Racing RPM Apprentice.

1.027 - exe, download and install, enables OTA updates through future Android app
1.028 - First OTA update, must manually update to 1.027 before running OTA update in the Android app
1.029 - Fix scrolling on the app and added reset button
1.033 - Added reset functionality for WiFi ssid and password
1.035 - Removed WiFi and replaced with Bluetooth
1.055 - WMH-RPM-Apprentice-Bootstrap-1.055.zip
